      "Sales Performance by Digit Usage:\n",
      "\n",
      "  Digits in Title:\n",
      "    WITH digits: 878 total | Avg: 8.9 | Count: 99 titles\n",
      "    WITHOUT digits: 7592 total | Avg: 7.7 | Count: 983 titles\n",
      "    ➜ WITH digits performs 14.7% BETTER ✓\n",
